<item>
            <title>[IGNITE-19564] Snapshot restoration metric is not always assigned when an error occurs.</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-19564</link>
                <project id="12315922" key="IGNITE">Ignite</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;The metric of last snapshot process might not be assigned in case of failed snapshot restoration. Happens when an error occurs on the process preparation, before launching. The cause is that we assign the holder of last process context after some checks which can raise an exception.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
